<!-- Startup Screen page. Labels and footers are keys into <lang>.lproj/StartupScreen.strings. Keys are the
     SS_KEY_* of ../../StartupScreen.h. The table header (OMCStartupScreenController) holds the live preview
     card and the style gallery (it writes startupScreenStyle), so there is no style row here.
     "ssStyles" lists the startup styles (SS_STYLE_*) a row shows for; rows without it always show.
     Groups with an "id" get their header / footer from code (style name, weather status, current sound...).
     "ssRandomStyle" rows are the Random style's checklist (toggleRandomStyle: flips them).
     "Add video" / "Choose logo" ask Photos or Files; "Choose sound" opens Files. -->
